WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.261
- My body is ready to eat

00:00:02.261 --> 00:00:03.653
bunch of food!

00:00:03.653 --> 00:00:04.950
Uh, uh, uh.

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:07.533
(upbeat music)

00:00:09.128 --> 00:00:12.444
- We are here at Bon Shabu
in Koreatown Los Angeles.

00:00:12.444 --> 00:00:15.920
We're back to do some
spicy food challenge here.

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:16.902
- Oh, right

00:00:16.902 --> 00:00:18.195
(laughing)

00:00:18.195 --> 00:00:19.474
I was just ready for lunch.

00:00:19.474 --> 00:00:21.252
- So you've never tried hot pot?

00:00:21.252 --> 00:00:22.895
- I've never had hot pot before.

00:00:22.895 --> 00:00:23.728
- Wow.

00:00:23.728 --> 00:00:25.316
- Just in general you've
never had a hot pot.

00:00:25.316 --> 00:00:26.798
- So I'm really glad that I'm starting

00:00:26.798 --> 00:00:28.295
it out with a spicy challenge.

00:00:28.295 --> 00:00:30.264
(dramatic music)

00:00:30.264 --> 00:00:32.729
- [Man] All right so
we've got meat, seafood,

00:00:32.729 --> 00:00:34.238
broth, veggies, sauce.

00:00:34.238 --> 00:00:35.746
- Five dishes, this is like a feast,

00:00:35.746 --> 00:00:37.330
there's everything you need here.

00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:38.913
- [Middle Woman] I'm gonna
bring everyone I've ever known

00:00:38.913 --> 00:00:39.776
to eat all this food.

00:00:39.776 --> 00:00:41.098
- You know what we should do?

00:00:41.098 --> 00:00:43.349
We should do a challenge where
one person eats all of it.

00:00:43.349 --> 00:00:46.253
- Yeah, YB is just nominating herself.

00:00:46.253 --> 00:00:48.870
- [Man] Apparently, the
white one's the spicier one.

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:51.422
- Which is weird cause this
doesn't look spicy at all.

00:00:51.422 --> 00:00:53.205
- [Man] let's try the broth first,

00:00:53.205 --> 00:00:54.865
let's try the mild one first.

00:00:54.865 --> 00:00:55.698
- Hot!

00:00:55.698 --> 00:00:56.858
- Mm, it's great

00:00:56.858 --> 00:00:58.345
- It's kinda sweet

00:00:58.345 --> 00:01:00.568
- Yeah, it's kinda like...

00:01:00.568 --> 00:01:01.964
like Udon soup.

00:01:01.964 --> 00:01:05.001
- It is good, although it's
very hot; my tongue burned.

00:01:05.001 --> 00:01:06.429
- [Man] Alright, now the spicy one.

00:01:06.429 --> 00:01:07.436
- [Middle Woman] I smell the spicy,

00:01:07.436 --> 00:01:08.898
it smells almost like jalapeño.

00:01:08.898 --> 00:01:12.422
- That's what I was gonna say,
yeah it smells like jalapeño.

00:01:12.422 --> 00:01:13.504
- Ooh, oh wow.

00:01:13.504 --> 00:01:14.354
- Oh!

00:01:14.354 --> 00:01:16.587
(laughing)

00:01:16.587 --> 00:01:17.678
- That's pretty spicy.

00:01:17.678 --> 00:01:18.791
- That went like straight up.

00:01:18.791 --> 00:01:21.514
- A lot of spicy food that we
eat, usually just takes time

00:01:21.514 --> 00:01:22.798
this was just like...

00:01:22.798 --> 00:01:24.716
- Hits you in the face immediately,

00:01:24.716 --> 00:01:26.306
but then it slides down your throat

00:01:26.306 --> 00:01:28.396
and then hits you in the
back of the throat, too.

00:01:28.396 --> 00:01:31.305
And you're like, full on
mouth explosion of spice.

00:01:31.305 --> 00:01:32.267
Oh, I like it.

00:01:32.267 --> 00:01:34.171
- [Man] Alright, let's put some food in.

00:01:34.171 --> 00:01:36.754
(upbeat music)

00:01:38.485 --> 00:01:40.775
Oh this broth is, it's spicy yet so good.

00:01:40.775 --> 00:01:42.270
- It's really good, yeah.

00:01:42.270 --> 00:01:43.404
- I can't stop drinking it.

00:01:43.404 --> 00:01:45.386
It's for sure, like I
could smell and taste that

00:01:45.386 --> 00:01:49.728
it's based off of peppers,
jalapenos, green peppers.

00:01:49.728 --> 00:01:51.483
It goes so well with the meat.

00:01:51.483 --> 00:01:54.122
The meat soaks in the soup,
the broth really well.

00:01:54.122 --> 00:01:56.835
- This is the opposite of every
other challenge we've done.

00:01:56.835 --> 00:01:58.280
- You like actually want to keep going.

00:01:58.280 --> 00:01:59.404
- You're like I want to stop.

00:01:59.404 --> 00:02:02.795
- If I came here with my
friends I would get the mild.

00:02:02.795 --> 00:02:03.628
- Really?

00:02:03.628 --> 00:02:04.621
I'd get the spicy.

00:02:04.621 --> 00:02:06.686
That or I'd get one of each,
so I'd have other friends

00:02:06.686 --> 00:02:08.294
that are lame that get the other one.

00:02:08.294 --> 00:02:09.643
- She's the lame friend, right?

00:02:09.643 --> 00:02:10.777
- Yeah she's the lame one.

00:02:10.777 --> 00:02:13.194
- Noo! I'm just closer to it.

00:02:14.189 --> 00:02:15.022
- Oooh!

00:02:15.022 --> 00:02:16.942
- I like watching Evan suffer, it's funny.

00:02:16.942 --> 00:02:18.220
- Evan crying is the best.

00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:19.902
(laughing)

00:02:19.902 --> 00:02:23.068
- I've never heard YB be
that brutal on camera before.

00:02:23.068 --> 00:02:25.906
- I kind of doubted it
when it was white, oh man.

00:02:25.906 --> 00:02:28.530
- If you're not into spicy
food, this would be so spicy.

00:02:28.530 --> 00:02:31.084
- Yeah, I love the pain
when I eat spicy food.

00:02:31.084 --> 00:02:32.231
It's kind of weird.

00:02:32.231 --> 00:02:33.351
- It's a little weird.

00:02:33.351 --> 00:02:34.692
- It's okay I like pain too.

00:02:34.692 --> 00:02:36.383
- [Man] Yeah.

00:02:36.383 --> 00:02:38.599
- Is this now becoming
an eating challenge?

00:02:38.599 --> 00:02:40.880
Like can we finish all of
this between the three of us?

00:02:40.880 --> 00:02:41.713
- Hell yeah!

00:02:41.713 --> 00:02:42.619
(laughing)

00:02:42.619 --> 00:02:44.650
- YB's like that's what I wanted.

00:02:44.650 --> 00:02:45.869
- Challenge number two.

00:02:45.869 --> 00:02:46.904
Is this all you can eat?

00:02:46.904 --> 00:02:48.074
- Yes this all you can eat.

00:02:48.074 --> 00:02:49.878
- I don't know, is it
all you can eat meat too?

00:02:49.878 --> 00:02:51.409
- Yeah everything's all you can eat.

00:02:51.409 --> 00:02:52.242
- Wow!

00:02:52.242 --> 00:02:54.142
(upbeat music)

00:02:54.142 --> 00:02:55.962
- [Right Woman] Spice wise...

00:02:55.962 --> 00:02:56.795
It was...

00:02:56.795 --> 00:02:59.880
you can handle it, you know
it's not like a dying spice.

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:02.410
Still very spicy, it
kicks you in the throat

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:03.332
in the beginning.

00:03:03.332 --> 00:03:04.165
- Delicious?

00:03:04.165 --> 00:03:04.998
Yes.

00:03:04.998 --> 00:03:05.831
Spicy?

00:03:05.831 --> 00:03:06.664
Yes.

00:03:08.386 --> 00:03:11.053
- A man of few words, our Evan.

